WEBVTT

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:03.151
The bar at the top tells you <b>how the day is going</b>

00:00:03.196 --> 00:00:09.706
The numbers are hidden in case a customer sees the screen; tap the eye to show them

00:00:09.842 --> 00:00:13.232
What you have sold today, and in how many sales

00:00:13.281 --> 00:00:16.192
<b>Stock bajo</b> (low stock) warns you about what is running out

00:00:16.236 --> 00:00:21.868
Send the list on WhatsApp as text or as a PDF to order from your supplier

00:00:21.919 --> 00:00:26.351
And each product warns you when only a few are left
